Beach 001
  models/external/beach_001/
  Author:  DEEP C (https://sketchfab.com/deepc326)
  Source:  https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/beach-001-49d3a0ccbad44d039556bf7c142af25b
  Use:     its 8192x8192 photogrammetry texture, not its geometry. The mesh is
           798,000 triangles for a 1.2 x 1.6 m patch and cannot be tiled across
           a 120 m seabed. The texture was cropped, divided by a heavy blur of
           itself to remove the sun gradient baked into the photograph, mirrored
           to tile seamlessly, and used to derive normal and roughness maps.
           Result: models/textures/sand_albedo.png, sand_normal.png,
           sand_roughness.png.

