Greek underwater broken statue 1
  Author:  assetfactory (https://sketchfab.com/assetfactory)
  Source:  https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/greek-underwater-broken-statue-1-7098d62953b44879bd8f1bfbdc55f4b3
  NOT USED. Recorded because it was tried and removed, so that nobody repeats
  the attempt. It segfaults Gazebo inside
  gz::common::AssimpLoader::CreateMaterial, reproducible headless and isolated
  by bisecting each model separately. Neither stripping its metallicRoughness
  maps nor flattening its texture folder fixed it. This is a loader bug rather
  than a fault in the asset, and it takes the whole server down. Re-exporting
  through Blender as a plain COLLADA file would avoid the glTF material path.


================================================================================
GENERATED CONTENT
================================================================================

Everything else in models/ is generated by this project and carries the MIT
licence of the repository:

  scripts/make_seabed.py    the seabed mesh, from uuv_mode_aware_navigation.seabed
  scripts/make_rocks.py     eight irregular rock meshes
  scripts/make_scenery.py   coral, sea fans, fish, wreck, pipeline and ship

The sea surface mesh, models/meshes/sea_surface.obj, is this project's own and
carries the same licence, but no script in this tree regenerates it. It is
committed for that reason.
